.TH BAREBUH 1 "September 2026" "Barebuh 0.1.0-dev1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
barebuh \- music player and federated internet-radio client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B barebuh
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ URLs ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Barebuh is a music player and collection organizer with an open federated
internet-radio directory. It is an independent modified fork of Strawberry
Music Player, which was derived from Clementine.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-p , " --play"
Start playback.
.TP
.BR \-t , " --play-pause"
Toggle playback.
.TP
.BR \-u , " --pause"
Pause playback.
.TP
.BR \-s , " --stop"
Stop playback.
.TP
.BR \-r , " --previous"
Play the previous track.
.TP
.BR \-f , " --next"
Play the next track.
.TP
.BR \-v , " --volume " value
Set volume.
.TP
.BR \-g , " --language " code
Set the interface language.
.TP
.BR \--version
Print version information.
.TP
.BR \-h , " --help"
Print full command-line help.
.SH FILES
Barebuh uses its own settings and local-data namespace and does not silently
share Strawberry's profile.
